# Dolibarr language file - Source file is en_US - hiddenconf
# Titles and descriptions of hidden constants, see htdocs/admin/tools/ui/resources/hidden-conf-list.lib.php

# Global Options
HiddenConfTitle_ADD_UNSPLASH_LOGIN_BACKGROUND=Use an image URL as background of the login page
HiddenConfDesc_ADD_UNSPLASH_LOGIN_BACKGROUND=Value is the URL of an image (for example a random image service). It is also used on the forgotten and reset password pages and takes precedence over the saved background image. An external site may then see every visit of your login page.
HiddenConfTitle_API_DISABLE_LOGIN_API=Disable the login entry point of the REST API
HiddenConfTitle_GRAPH_USE_FISCAL_YEAR=Start widget graphs on the first month of the fiscal year instead of January
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ALL_TOWN_TO_UPPER=Write town and address in uppercase
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ALL_TO_UPPER=Write third party, contact and member last names in uppercase
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ALL_TO_UPPER=Can alter names in languages where capitalization rules differ.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_APPLICATION_TITLE=Replace the application name shown on the login page and in the top bar
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_APPLICATION_TITLE=If the value starts with <code>+</code>, the text is appended to "Dolibarr" instead of replacing it. Changing the name may break version detection by mobile applications such as DoliDroid.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_AUTOFILL_DATE=Prefill date fields with today on invoice, order and payment forms
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_AUTOFILL_DATE=Not recommended: users may keep a wrong date without checking it.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_AUTOFILL_DATE_PROPOSAL=Prefill the date of a new proposal with today
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_AUTOFILL_DATE_PROPOSAL=Removed in version 23.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_AUTO_TIMESTAMP_IN_PRIVATE_NOTES=Insert date and user automatically when editing the private note
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_AUTO_TIMESTAMP_IN_PUBLIC_NOTES=Insert date and user automatically when editing the public note
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_CHECKBOX_LEFT_COLUMN=Show the column of selection checkboxes on the left of lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_CHECKBOX_LEFT_COLUMN=Default: 1 (left). Set 0 to put it on the right. Each user can override it in their own display setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_CREATEFROM_KEEP_LINE_ORIGIN_INFORMATION=Link each line created from another document to its source line
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_CREATEFROM_KEEP_LINE_ORIGIN_INFORMATION=Enabled by default (the value is forced to 1 when not defined). Set it to 0 to go back to the old, buggy behavior that stored the id of the line with the type of the parent object.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DEFAULT_LANGUAGE_FILTER=Exclude one language from the language selection lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DEFAULT_LANGUAGE_FILTER=Value is a language code, for example <code>en_US</code>, which cannot be removed by deleting its langs folder.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DEFAULT_PAYMENT_TERM_ID=Default payment term (ID) preselected in every payment term list
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DEFAULT_PAYMENT_TERM_ID=Deprecated: applies to the whole application, use the default values setup instead.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DEFAULT_PAYMENT_TYPE_ID=Default payment method (ID) preselected in every payment method list
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DEFAULT_PAYMENT_TYPE_ID=Deprecated: applies to the whole application (also new third parties), use the default values setup instead.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLEDRAFTSTATUS=Skip the draft status: create projects and check deposits directly validated
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLEDRAFTSTATUS=Only projects and check deposit slips use it today. <code>MAIN_DISABLEDRAFTSTATUS_PROJECT</code> and <code>MAIN_DISABLEDRAFTSTATUS_CHEQUE</code> do the same for one object only.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_AJAX_COMBOX=Disable the enhanced searchable select boxes (select2) everywhere
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_AJAX_COMBOX=Plain HTML select lists are used instead. This is not limited to third parties.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_CONTACTS_TAB=Hide the Contacts/Addresses tab on object cards
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_FULL_SCANLIST=Do not count all records on lists (faster on very large tables)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_FULL_SCANLIST=The total number of records and pages is no longer computed, which saves a full scan on tables with millions of rows.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_JQUERY_JNOTIFY=Show confirmation and error messages inside the page instead of floating popups
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_MULTIPLE_FILEUPLOAD=Allow only one file per upload in the file sending forms
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_NOTES_TAB=Hide the Notes tab on object cards
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_PDF_THUMBS=Do not build preview thumbnails of PDF files
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_PDF_THUMBS=Useful when Imagick is missing or crashes.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_SELECT2_FOCUS_PROTECTION=Disable the focus workaround of select2 combo lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_SELECT2_FOCUS_PROTECTION=By default a JavaScript fix gives the focus to the search field when a select2 combo opens (otherwise Ajax combos may need a second click). Disable it only if it conflicts with a custom script.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_TRUNC=Never truncate long texts in lists and select boxes
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOC_SORT_FIELD=Default sort field of the Documents tab
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOC_SORT_FIELD=Default is the file name.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOC_SORT_ORDER=Default sort order of the Documents tab
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOC_SORT_ORDER=<code>ASC</code> (default) or <code>DESC</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOC_UPLOAD_NOT_RENAME_BY_DEFAULT=Uncheck by default the option to rename uploaded files
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOC_USE_OBJECT_THIRDPARTY_NAME=Prefix the file name of third party ODT documents with the third party name
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOC_USE_TIMING=Add a date and time suffix to the file name of generated ODT documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOC_USE_TIMING=Value is a date format such as <code>%%Y%%m%%d%%H%%M</code>. With <code>1</code>, <code>%%Y%%m%%d%%H%%M%%S</code> is used.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOL_SCRIPTS_ROOT=Path of the folder containing the scripts directory, shown in the cron command line
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOL_SCRIPTS_ROOT=Used to build the command line suggested on the scheduled jobs setup page, for example <code>/var/www/dolibarr</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DONT_KEEP_NOTE_ON_CLONING=Do not copy notes when cloning a proposal or an invoice
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DONT_KEEP_NOTE_ON_CLONING=Applies to proposals, customer invoices and supplier invoices.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EMAILCOLLECTOR_MAIL_WITHOUT_HEADER=Do not keep email headers in messages saved by the email collector
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EMAILCOLLECTOR_MAIL_WITHOUT_HEADER=Enabled by default by the Ticket module.
HiddenConfWarning_MAIN_EMAILCOLLECTOR_MAIL_WITHOUT_HEADER=Bug in the setup page: without JavaScript, the Yes/No selector shows the value of <code>TICKET_AUTO_READ_WHEN_CREATED_FROM_BACKEND</code> instead of this option.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ENABLE_AJAX_TOOLTIP=Load the tooltips of object links with an Ajax request
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ENABLE_AJAX_TOOLTIP=The tooltip content is fetched when the mouse goes over the link instead of being built with the page, which makes long lists lighter.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ENABLE_IMPORT_LINKED_OBJECT_LINES=Allow importing lines from linked documents into the current document
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ENABLE_LOG_TO_HTML=Allow showing logs inside pages by adding <code>logtohtml=1</code> to the URL
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FEATURES_LEVEL=Level of features to show: stable, experimental or development
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FEATURES_LEVEL=<code>0</code> stable only (default), <code>1</code> adds experimental features, <code>2</code> adds features under development.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FILESYSTEM_ENCODING=Force the character encoding of the server file system
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FILESYSTEM_ENCODING=Use it when file names with accents are wrong. By default Dolibarr assumes <code>UTF-8</code> on Linux and macOS and <code>ISO-8859-1</code> on Windows.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FIRST_TO_UPPER=Capitalize the first letter of each word of third party, contact and member names
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FIRST_TO_UPPER=Can alter names in languages where capitalization rules differ.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FORCELANGDIR=Load translation files from another directory first
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FORCELANGDIR=Value is a path relative to the Dolibarr root, for example <code>/mymodule</code> to read <code>/mymodule/langs/xx_XX</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FREE_PRODUCT_CHECKED_BY_DEFAULT=Preselect the free text line when adding a line to a document
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FREE_PRODUCT_CHECKED_BY_DEFAULT=Any value checks the free line option by default on proposals, orders and invoices. With <code>product</code> or <code>service</code>, this line type is also preselected.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_HELPCENTER_LINKTOUSE=URL of the "Need help" link shown on the login page
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_HIDE_POWERED_BY=Hide the "Powered by Dolibarr" logo on public pages
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_HOOK_DEBUG=Log every hook call in the Dolibarr logs
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_HOOK_DEBUG=Writes a debug line for each hook method found and called, which is very verbose. Any non zero value enables it, there is no higher level.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_HTML_TITLE=Control the content of the browser tab title
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_HTML_TITLE=List of keywords: <code>showapp</code> adds the application name, <code>thirdpartynameonly</code>, <code>contactnameonly</code> and <code>projectnameonly</code> show only the object name on its tabs. Default is <code>thirdpartynameonly,contactnameonly,projectnameonly</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_HTTP_CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY=Content Security Policy header sent with pages
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_HTTP_CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY=Removed in version 17.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_KEEP_REF_CUSTOMER_ON_CLONING=Keep the customer reference when cloning a proposal or an order
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_LANGUAGES_ALLOWED=Restrict the available languages to this list
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_LANGUAGES_ALLOWED=Comma separated language codes without spaces. Other languages are hidden from the language lists.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_LINK_BY_REF=Link objects by choosing their type and entering their reference
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_LIST_ALLOW_PRIVATE_NOTES=Allow the private note as a column of lists
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_LIST_ALLOW_PUBLIC_NOTES=Allow the public note as a column of lists
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_LOGIN_BADCHARUNAUTHORIZED=Characters forbidden in user logins
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_LOGIN_BADCHARUNAUTHORIZED=Used only when <code>$dolibarr_login_badcharunauthorized</code> is set to <code>'MAIN_LOGIN_BADCHARUNAUTHORIZED'</code> in conf.php. The value is the plain list of forbidden characters (not a regular expression). Default: comma, at sign, angle brackets and quotes.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_LOGOUT_GOTO_URL=URL to redirect users to after logout
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAXLIST_OVERLOAD=Maximum number of records loaded in the summary lists of home areas
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAXLIST_OVERLOAD=Used for draft or open objects on home pages and some tabs. Default is 500.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAXTABS_IN_CARD=Maximum number of tabs shown on a card, the others go in a dropdown
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAXTABS_IN_CARD=Default is 99.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MIN_NB_ENABLED_MODULE_FOR_WARNING=Show the "setup not complete" warning while fewer modules than this are enabled
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MIN_NB_ENABLED_MODULE_FOR_WARNING=Only modules not enabled automatically are counted. Default is 1, set 0 to never show the warning.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MODULE_SETUP_ON_LIST_BY_DEFAULT=Default view of the modules setup page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MODULE_SETUP_ON_LIST_BY_DEFAULT=<code>common</code> for the list view, <code>commonkanban</code> (default) for the cards view.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NB_OF_YEAR_IN_WIDGET_GRAPH=Number of years shown in widget graphs
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NB_OF_YEAR_IN_WIDGET_GRAPH=Default is 3 (5 for the invoices per year widget).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NO_CONCAT_DESCRIPTION=Use only the typed description on lines, without the product description
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NO_CONCAT_DESCRIPTION=Removed in version 22: use the description options of the Products module setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NO_INPUT_PRICE_WITH_TAX=Remove the unit price including tax field from document lines
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NO_INPUT_PRICE_WITH_TAX=Applies to the add and edit line forms of proposals, orders, invoices, etc. Forced to 1 when your company uses a second or third local tax: set it explicitly to 0 to keep the field.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ONLY_LOGIN_ALLOWED=Maintenance mode: only these logins can connect
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ONLY_LOGIN_ALLOWED=One login, or several separated by semicolons. Any other user is refused, even if already connected. It is filled automatically by the button that blocks other sessions in Admin tools.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_OPTIMIZEFORTEXTBROWSER=Simplify the interface for text browsers and screen readers
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_OPTIMIZEFORTEXTBROWSER=Set automatically for text browsers such as lynx, and can also be set per user.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_OPTIMIZE_SPEED=Enable experimental speed optimizations (bit mask)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_OPTIMIZE_SPEED=Bit <code>2</code> enables a shared memory cache (shmop) for translations and other data. It is not reliable, Memcached is a better choice.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PAGESIZE_CHOICES=Choices offered in the "number of lines per page" selector of lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PAGESIZE_CHOICES=Comma separated <code>value:label</code> pairs.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PASSWORD_FORGOTLINK=Replace the target URL of the "Password forgotten" link on the login page
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PHONE_SEPAR=Separator used when formatting phone numbers
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PHONE_SEPAR=Default is a space.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROPAGATE_CONTACTS_FROM_ORIGIN=Copy the contacts of the source object when creating an object from another one
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROPAGATE_CONTACTS_FROM_ORIGIN=Enabled by default (<code>*</code>). Set to <code>0</code> to stop copying contacts, for example from a proposal to an order or invoice.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PUBLIC_NOTE_IN_ADDRESS=Print the third party public note in the address block of PDF documents
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_REMOVE_INSTALL_WARNING=Hide the security warning about the install pages on the home page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_REMOVE_INSTALL_WARNING=Better fix the cause: create an <code>install.lock</code> file in the documents directory.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_REPEATCONTACTONEACHTAB=Show the contacts on every tab of a card, not only the main one
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_REPEATCONTACTONEACHTAB=Removed in version 7.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ROUNDOFTOTAL_NOT_TOTALOFROUND=Compute customer document totals by rounding the total instead of summing rounded lines
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ROUNDOFTOTAL_NOT_TOTALOFROUND=Applies to proposals, orders and invoices. Expense reports always use the sum of rounded lines.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ROUNDOFTOTAL_NOT_TOTALOFROUND_SUPPLIER=Compute supplier document totals by rounding the total instead of summing rounded lines
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ROUNDOFTOTAL_NOT_TOTALOFROUND_SUPPLIER=Same as <code>MAIN_ROUNDOFTOTAL_NOT_TOTALOFROUND</code> for supplier proposals, orders and invoices.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SEARCHFORM_SUPPLIER_INVOICE_DISABLED=Remove supplier invoices from the global search
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SEARCH_DIRECT_OPEN_IF_ONLY_ONE=Open the record directly when a search finds only one result
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SEARCH_DIRECT_OPEN_IF_ONLY_ONE=Enabled by default. Set to <code>0</code> to show the list with a single line instead.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SEARCH_FORM_ON_HOME_AREAS=Show search forms on the home pages of modules
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SEARCH_FORM_ON_HOME_AREAS=Mostly redundant with the global search in the top bar.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SERVER_TZ=Force the time zone used by PHP on the server
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SERVER_TZ=Use only if the PHP time zone cannot be set, ideally to <code>UTC</code>. <code>auto</code> keeps the PHP setting. Changing it later shifts the dates already saved.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SERVICES_ARE_ECOMMERCE_200238EC=Use the VAT rates of the buyer country for services sold to EU individuals
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SERVICES_ARE_ECOMMERCE_200238EC=Removed. Value <code>1</code> mixed seller and buyer country rates, <code>2</code> offered only the buyer country rates.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SHOWDATABASENAMEINHELPPAGESLINK=Show the database name next to the version in the top bar tooltip
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SHOW_ALL_FILES_ON_DOCUMENT_TOOLTIP=Show uploaded files too in the documents popup of lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SHOW_ALL_FILES_ON_DOCUMENT_TOOLTIP=By default the popup only lists the generated documents (named exactly like the reference). With this option, every file whose name starts with the reference is listed.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SHOW_TECHNICAL_ID=Show technical IDs on cards and in some lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SHOW_TECHNICAL_ID=Not supported on every page.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SHOW_TUNING_INFO=Log performance information (cache setup) in the browser JavaScript console
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SHOW_TUNING_INFO=The page build time is only shown when <code>MAIN_SHOW_TUNING_INFO</code> is set as a web server environment variable.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_STATS_GRAPHS_SHOW_N_YEARS=Number of past years shown on statistics pages
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_STATS_GRAPHS_SHOW_N_YEARS=Integer between 1 and 10, default 2. Used by the statistics pages of the modules (orders, members, projects, expense reports...).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_STORE_COMPUTED_EXTRAFIELDS=Store the result of computed extra fields in the database
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_STORE_COMPUTED_EXTRAFIELDS=The formula is evaluated when the object is saved and the result is written in the column, so lists can sort, filter and sum on it. The stored value is a snapshot, refreshed only when the record is saved again.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_UNKNOWN_CUSTOMERS_ARE_COMPANIES=Consider third parties of unknown nature as companies
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_UNKNOWN_CUSTOMERS_ARE_COMPANIES=Used for VAT rules when nothing (VAT number, professional ID, type) tells if it is a company. Default <code>0</code> treats them as individuals.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_ADVANCED_PERMS=Enable advanced permissions
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_ADVANCED_PERMS=Adds finer permissions in some modules, for example separate rights to validate or to send documents.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_ALTERNATE_TRANSLATION_FOR=Fields of objects that can receive a translation in other languages
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_ALTERNATE_TRANSLATION_FOR=Format: <code>element:field1,field2</code>, several elements separated by <code>;</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_HOURMIN_IN_DATE_RANGE=Add hours and minutes to the start and end dates of document lines
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_JQUERY_JEDITABLE=Edit some fields of cards in place with Ajax
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_JQUERY_JEDITABLE=Removed in version 24. It skipped business checks and triggers.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_JQUERY_MULTISELECT=jQuery plugin used for multiple selection lists
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_JQUERY_MULTISELECT=Empty or <code>1</code> means <code>select2</code>, the only value really supported.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_OLD_SEARCH_FORM=Use the old search form of the left menu instead of the search combo
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_OLD_SEARCH_FORM=Only when the search is not in the top menu. It is also forced on smartphones.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_TOP_MENU_QUICKADD_DROPDOWN=Add a quick creation menu (+) in the top bar
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_TOP_MENU_SEARCH_DROPDOWN=Move the search field into the top menu
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_VAT_COMPANIES_IN_EEC_WITH_INVALID_VAT_ID_ARE_INDIVIDUAL=Treat EU companies without a valid VAT number as individuals for VAT
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_VAT_COMPANIES_IN_EEC_WITH_INVALID_VAT_ID_ARE_INDIVIDUAL=Removed in version 23.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_VAT_OF_PRODUCT_FOR_COMPANIES_IN_EEC_WITH_INVALID_VAT_ID=Apply the product VAT rate to EU companies without a valid VAT number
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_VAT_OF_PRODUCT_FOR_COMPANIES_IN_EEC_WITH_INVALID_VAT_ID=Removed in version 14.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_VAT_OF_PRODUCT_FOR_INDIVIDUAL_CUSTOMER_OUT_OF_EEC=Apply the product VAT rate to individual customers outside the EU
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_VAT_OF_PRODUCT_FOR_INDIVIDUAL_CUSTOMER_OUT_OF_EEC=Normally no VAT applies to them, there is rarely a reason to enable it.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_ZIPTOWN_DICTIONNARY=Suggest zip codes and towns from the zip/town dictionary
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_ZIPTOWN_DICTIONNARY=Without it, suggestions come from the addresses of existing third parties.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_VAT_DEFAULT_IF_AUTODETECT_FAILS=VAT rate to use when no default rate can be found
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_VAT_DEFAULT_IF_AUTODETECT_FAILS=Replaces the highest rate of the country. A VAT code can follow in parentheses, for example <code>20 (CODE)</code>. <code>none</code> leaves the rate empty.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_VIEW_LINE_NUMBER=Show a line number in front of each line of documents on screen
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_VIEW_LINE_NUMBER=Screen only. Use <code>PDF_ADD_POSITION</code> for PDF documents.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_VIEW_LINE_NUMBER_IN_LIST=Show a line number in some lists
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_VOLUME_DEFAULT_ROUND=Number of decimals of volume totals
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_VOLUME_DEFAULT_UNIT=Unit used to display volume totals
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_VOLUME_DEFAULT_UNIT=Power of ten relative to m³: <code>0</code> m³, <code>-3</code> dm³, <code>-6</code> cm³. By default the best unit is chosen.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_WEIGHT_DEFAULT_ROUND=Number of decimals of weight totals
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_WEIGHT_DEFAULT_UNIT=Unit used to display weight totals and preselected on new products
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_WEIGHT_DEFAULT_UNIT=Power of ten relative to kg: <code>0</code> kg, <code>-3</code> g, <code>3</code> t. By default the best unit is chosen for totals.
HiddenConfTitle_SHOW_SOCINFO_ON_PRINT=Add your company details on pages printed with the print button
HiddenConfTitle_SOCIETE_ON_SEARCH_AND_LIST_GO_ON_CUSTOMER_OR_SUPPLIER_CARD=Link third parties in lists and search to their customer or supplier card
HiddenConfTitle_USER_HIDE_INACTIVE_IN_COMBOBOX=Hide disabled users in user selection lists

# Security Options
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ALLOW_SVG_FILES_AS_IMAGES=Accept SVG files as images
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ALLOW_SVG_FILES_AS_IMAGES=Not recommended: an SVG file can embed JavaScript and be used for XSS attacks.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MODULES_FOR_EXTERNAL=Modules available to external users
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MODULES_FOR_EXTERNAL=Comma separated list of module names. Default: user, societe, propal, commande, facture, categorie, supplierproposal, fournisseur, contact, projet, contrat, ficheinter, expedition, reception, agenda, resource, adherent, blockedlog, ticket. External modules can add themselves to this list.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_RESTRICTHTML_ONLY_VALID_HTML=Reject HTML content that is not valid HTML
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_RESTRICTHTML_ONLY_VALID_HTML=Enabled by default (1): HTML fields are parsed and rebuilt with the PHP DOM extension. Value 2 also removes some style attributes. Set 0 to disable.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_RESTRICTHTML_ONLY_VALID_HTML_TIDY=Repair and sanitize HTML content with the Tidy library
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_RESTRICTHTML_ONLY_VALID_HTML_TIDY=Enabled by default when the PHP tidy extension is installed. Set 0 to disable.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_RESTRICTHTML_REMOVE_ALSO_BAD_ATTRIBUTES=Also remove non standard attributes from HTML content
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_RESTRICTHTML_REMOVE_ALSO_BAD_ATTRIBUTES=Disabled by default. When enabled, attributes that are not in the allowed list are stripped from HTML fields.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SECURITY_ALLOW_UNSECURED_LABELS_WITH_HTML=Allow basic HTML in product labels and text fields
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SECURITY_ALLOW_UNSECURED_LABELS_WITH_HTML=By default these labels are stripped of any HTML tag. With this option a restricted HTML is kept (product labels, barcode sheets, text fields). Lowers security.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SECURITY_ANTI_SSRF_SERVER_IP=IP addresses of the server, used by the anti-SSRF checks
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SECURITY_ANTI_SSRF_SERVER_IP=Comma separated list. When Dolibarr fetches an external URL, these IPs are refused like local ones. When only local URLs are allowed, the target IP must be in this list.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SECURITY_CSRF_WITH_TOKEN=Level of the anti-CSRF token check
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SECURITY_CSRF_WITH_TOKEN=0: no token check, 1: POST requests only, 2: also GET requests with a sensitive action (delete, remove...), 3 (default): also every GET request with an action or massaction parameter. Some external modules may not support level 3.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SECURITY_FORCERP=Value of the Referrer-Policy HTTP header
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SECURITY_FORCERP=Default: <code>same-origin</code>, so no referrer is sent to other sites. Other standard values such as <code>strict-origin-when-cross-origin</code> can be used.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SECURITY_MAX_IMG_IN_HTML_CONTENT=Maximum number of images allowed in an HTML content
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SECURITY_MAX_IMG_IN_HTML_CONTENT=Content with more images is refused. Default: 1000.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SECURITY_SALT=Salt added to passwords before hashing
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SECURITY_SALT=Only used when the hashing algorithm is not password_hash (the default). Changing it makes the passwords already hashed with a salt unusable.

# Members Module
HiddenConfTitle_ADHERENT_DEFAULT_CREATE_THIRDPARTY=Create a third party automatically when a member is created
HiddenConfDesc_ADHERENT_DEFAULT_CREATE_THIRDPARTY=Applies to the member card and to the public registration form.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NB_OF_YEAR_IN_MEMBERSHIP_WIDGET_GRAPH=Number of years taken into account in the member widgets and graph
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NB_OF_YEAR_IN_MEMBERSHIP_WIDGET_GRAPH=Only members whose subscription ends after January 1st of the current year minus this number are counted. Empty or 0 (default): all members.
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_ALLOW_CHANGE_OF_TYPE=Let members change their member type on the public payment page
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_NEWFORM_FORCEMORPHY=Force the member nature on the public registration form
HiddenConfDesc_MEMBER_NEWFORM_FORCEMORPHY=<code>phy</code> for an individual, <code>mor</code> for a legal entity.
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_NO_SYNC_LINKED_THIRDPARTY=Do not update the linked third party when a member is modified
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_SUBSCRIPTION_SUGGEST_END_OF_MONTH=Suggest the end of the month as end date of a new subscription
HiddenConfDesc_MEMBER_SUBSCRIPTION_SUGGEST_END_OF_MONTH=By default no end date is suggested. Takes precedence over <code>MEMBER_SUBSCRIPTION_SUGGEST_END_OF_YEAR</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_SUBSCRIPTION_SUGGEST_END_OF_YEAR=Suggest the end of the year as end date of a new subscription
HiddenConfDesc_MEMBER_SUBSCRIPTION_SUGGEST_END_OF_YEAR=By default no end date is suggested.

# Accounting Module
HiddenConfTitle_ACCOUNTANCY_COMBO_FOR_AUX=Use a combo list to select subledger accounts
HiddenConfDesc_ACCOUNTANCY_COMBO_FOR_AUX=May make the accounting pages very slow with a large number of third parties.
HiddenConfTitle_ACCOUNTANCY_USE_PRODUCT_ACCOUNT_ON_THIRDPARTY=Allow sale and purchase accounting accounts on third parties
HiddenConfDesc_ACCOUNTANCY_USE_PRODUCT_ACCOUNT_ON_THIRDPARTY=Adds two fields on the third party card. When filled, they are suggested for the binding of the lines of this third party, with priority over the product accounts.
HiddenConfTitle_ACCOUNTING_DEFAULT_NOT_NOTIFIED_EXPORT_DATE=Check by default the option to flag lines as exported in the accounting export
HiddenConfDesc_ACCOUNTING_DEFAULT_NOT_NOTIFIED_EXPORT_DATE=Despite its name, value 1 checks the box that records the export date on the exported lines, empty or 0 leaves it unchecked.
HiddenConfTitle_ACCOUNTING_DEFAULT_NOT_NOTIFIED_VALIDATION_DATE=Leave unchecked by default the validation of lines in the accounting export
HiddenConfDesc_ACCOUNTING_DEFAULT_NOT_NOTIFIED_VALIDATION_DATE=1: the box to validate (lock) the exported lines is unchecked by default, 0: checked.
HiddenConfTitle_ACCOUNTING_MANAGE_ZERO=Keep accounting account numbers as entered, without padding zeros
HiddenConfDesc_ACCOUNTING_MANAGE_ZERO=By default accounts are completed with zeros up to the length set in the accounting setup, so 1 and 10 can end up identical. With this option trailing zeros are significant.

# Agenda Module
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_ADDACTIONFOREMAIL=Show a link to create an event next to email addresses
HiddenConfDesc_AGENDA_ADDACTIONFOREMAIL=The link opens the event creation form with the email type, prefilled with the contact or third party. Requires the right to create events.
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_ADDACTIONFORPHONE=Show a link to create an event next to phone numbers
HiddenConfDesc_AGENDA_ADDACTIONFORPHONE=The link opens the event creation form with the phone call type, prefilled with the contact or third party.
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_ALL_CALENDARS=Show the events of all users by default in the agenda
HiddenConfDesc_AGENDA_ALL_CALENDARS=Applies to the calendar views and the event list. Without it, only the events of the current user are shown first.
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_AUTOSET_END_DATE_WITH_DELTA_HOURS=Hours added to the start date to fill a missing event end date
HiddenConfDesc_AGENDA_AUTOSET_END_DATE_WITH_DELTA_HOURS=When an event is saved without end date, the end date becomes start date plus this number of hours. Default: 1.
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_DISABLE_LOCATION=Hide the location field of events
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_MAX_EVENTS_DAY_VIEW=Maximum number of events shown per day in the calendar views
HiddenConfDesc_AGENDA_MAX_EVENTS_DAY_VIEW=Default: 3. Extra events are hidden behind a link.
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_SUPPORT_PRIORITY_IN_EVENTS=Show a priority field on events
HiddenConfTitle_AGENDA_USE_EVENT_TYPE=Use event types (the type becomes required on events)
HiddenConfDesc_AGENDA_USE_EVENT_TYPE=Deprecated option, now set from the agenda setup page.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ACTIONCOM_CAN_ADD_ANY_CONTACT=Allow any contact as event participant, not only those of the third party
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ACTIONCOM_CAN_ADD_ANY_CONTACT=May be very slow on large databases, since all contacts are loaded in the list.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ADD_EVENT_ON_ELEMENT_CARD=Add a button to create an event from document cards
HiddenConfWarning_MAIN_ADD_EVENT_ON_ELEMENT_CARD=No effect: all the code using this option is commented out.

# Bank Module
HiddenConfTitle_BANK_ASK_PAYMENT_BANK_DURING_ORDER=Ask for the bank account to use for payment on sales orders
HiddenConfTitle_BANK_ASK_PAYMENT_BANK_DURING_PROPOSAL=Ask for the bank account to use for payment on proposals
HiddenConfDesc_BANK_ASK_PAYMENT_BANK_DURING_PROPOSAL=Applies to commercial proposals and to supplier price requests.
HiddenConfTitle_BANK_CAN_RECONCILIATE_CASHACCOUNT=Allow reconciliation of cash accounts
HiddenConfTitle_BANK_DISABLE_CHECK_DEPOSIT=Hide the check deposit feature
HiddenConfDesc_BANK_DISABLE_CHECK_DEPOSIT=Removes the check deposit menu entry and its block on the home page.
HiddenConfTitle_BANK_USE_OLD_VARIOUS_PAYMENT=Enter miscellaneous bank entries directly in the account (old method)
HiddenConfDesc_BANK_USE_OLD_VARIOUS_PAYMENT=Deprecated. By default these entries are recorded as miscellaneous payments. This option brings back the direct entry form in the bank entries list and hides the miscellaneous payments menu.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_IBAN_IS_NEVER_MANDATORY=Never require IBAN and BIC on bank accounts

# BOM and MO Module
HiddenConfTitle_ALLOW_USE_KITS_INTO_BOM_AND_MO=Allow a kit as product to manufacture in a manufacturing order
HiddenConfDesc_ALLOW_USE_KITS_INTO_BOM_AND_MO=When the kits feature is enabled, creating a manufacturing order for a kit is refused unless this option is set.
HiddenConfTitle_BOM_SUB_BOM=Allow a bill of materials to include other bills of materials

# Bookmarks Module
HiddenConfTitle_BOOKMARKS_SHOW_IN_MENU=Maximum number of bookmarks shown in the bookmarks menu
HiddenConfDesc_BOOKMARKS_SHOW_IN_MENU=Empty or 0: no limit.

# Inalterable Log Module
HiddenConfTitle_BLOCKEDLOG_ADD_ACTIONS_SUPPORTED=Additional events to record in the unalterable log
HiddenConfDesc_BLOCKEDLOG_ADD_ACTIONS_SUPPORTED=Comma separated list of trigger codes, added to the built in list of recorded events.
HiddenConfTitle_BLOCKEDLOG_USE_REMOTE_AUTHORITY=Send the fingerprints of the unalterable log to a remote authority
HiddenConfDesc_BLOCKEDLOG_USE_REMOTE_AUTHORITY=Works with <code>BLOCKEDLOG_AUTHORITY_URL</code>, which holds the URL of the authority.
HiddenConfWarning_BLOCKEDLOG_USE_REMOTE_AUTHORITY=No effect: all the code using this option is commented out.

# Category-Tags Module
HiddenConfTitle_CATEGORY_EDIT_IN_MENU_NOT_IN_POPUP=Manage tags from menu entries instead of a popup
HiddenConfDesc_CATEGORY_EDIT_IN_MENU_NOT_IN_POPUP=By default tags are edited from a popup opened next to the tag selector. With this option the popup button is removed and tag entries are added to the left menu of the modules.
HiddenConfTitle_CATEGORY_SHOW_COUNTS=Show the number of objects of each tag in the tag tree

# Contracts
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=Create a public download link when a contract PDF is generated
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_HIDE_PLANNED_DATE_ON_PDF=Hide the planned service dates on the contract PDF
HiddenConfDesc_CONTRACT_HIDE_PLANNED_DATE_ON_PDF=Applies to the strato PDF template.
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_HIDE_PRICE_ON_PDF=Hide the prices on the contract PDF
HiddenConfDesc_CONTRACT_HIDE_PRICE_ON_PDF=Applies to the strato PDF template.
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_HIDE_QTY_ON_PDF=Hide the quantities on the contract PDF
HiddenConfDesc_CONTRACT_HIDE_QTY_ON_PDF=Applies to the strato PDF template.
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_HIDE_REAL_DATE_ON_PDF=Hide the real service dates on the contract PDF
HiddenConfDesc_CONTRACT_HIDE_REAL_DATE_ON_PDF=Applies to the strato PDF template.
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_SHOW_SIGNATURE_STATUS_WITH_SERVICE_STATUS=Show the signature status next to the service statuses of contracts
HiddenConfTitle_CONTRACT_SUPPORT_PRODUCTS=Allow products, not only services, on contract lines

# Cron module
HiddenConfTitle_CRON_DISABLE_KEY_CHANGE=Prevent changing the security key of scheduled jobs
HiddenConfDesc_CRON_DISABLE_KEY_CHANGE=1: the key is shown read only. -1: the key stays editable but without the generate button, with a warning. Useful on hosted instances where the cron command line contains the key.
HiddenConfTitle_CRON_DISABLE_TUTORIAL_CRON=Hide the help explaining how to set up the cron command
HiddenConfDesc_CRON_DISABLE_TUTORIAL_CRON=Useful on hosted instances where the host sets up the cron.
HiddenConfTitle_CRON_WARNING_DELAY_HOURS=Launch interval of the cron, in hours, shown as a warning
HiddenConfDesc_CRON_WARNING_DELAY_HOURS=Displays a message on the scheduled jobs pages saying that jobs can run with a delay of up to this number of hours.

# Direct Debit Orders
HiddenConfTitle_WITHDRAWAL_ALLOW_ANY_INVOICE_STATUS=Accept invoices of any status in direct debit and credit transfer orders
HiddenConfDesc_WITHDRAWAL_ALLOW_ANY_INVOICE_STATUS=By default only unpaid invoices are proposed, to avoid paying the same invoice twice.

# Donation Module
HiddenConfTitle_DONATION_USE_THIRDPARTIES=Link donations to a third party
HiddenConfDesc_DONATION_USE_THIRDPARTIES=The donor name and address then come from the third party.

# Email
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_INVOICE=Ask for a delivery receipt by default when sending an invoice by email
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_ORDER=Preselect "Yes" for the delivery receipt when sending a sales order by email
HiddenConfDesc_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_ORDER=The delivery receipt field is only displayed when <code>MAIN_EMAIL_SUPPORT_ACK</code> is also set.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_PROPAL=Preselect "Yes" for the delivery receipt when sending a commercial proposal by email
HiddenConfDesc_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_PROPAL=The delivery receipt field is only displayed when <code>MAIN_EMAIL_SUPPORT_ACK</code> is also set.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL=Preselect "Yes" for the delivery receipt when sending a price request by email
HiddenConfDesc_MAIL_FORCE_DELIVERY_RECEIPT_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL=The delivery receipt field is only displayed when <code>MAIN_EMAIL_SUPPORT_ACK</code> is also set.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_MASS_ACTION_SEARCH_MOST_RECENT_FILE_IF_NOT_FOUND=In mass email sending, attach the most recent document when the recorded file no longer exists
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_MAX_NB_OF_RECIPIENTS_IN_SAME_EMAIL=Maximum number of recipients (To + Cc + Bcc) allowed in one email
HiddenConfDesc_MAIL_MAX_NB_OF_RECIPIENTS_IN_SAME_EMAIL=Default is <code>10</code>. Sending is refused above this value. Separate limits can be set with <code>MAIL_MAX_NB_OF_RECIPIENTS_TO_IN_SAME_EMAIL</code>, <code>MAIL_MAX_NB_OF_RECIPIENTS_CC_IN_SAME_EMAIL</code> and <code>MAIL_MAX_NB_OF_RECIPIENTS_BCC_IN_SAME_EMAIL</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIL_PREFIX_FOR_EMAIL_ID=Prefix used to build the Message-ID of sent emails
HiddenConfDesc_MAIL_PREFIX_FOR_EMAIL_ID=Set a fixed string, or <code>SERVER_NAME</code> to use the virtual host name. By default a hash based on the instance unique id is used.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_COPY_FILE_IN_EVENT_AUTO=Copy the email attachments into the event created when sending an email
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EMAIL_ADD_TRACK_ID=Add a tracking id in emails to link replies to the source object (removed)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EMAIL_ADD_TRACK_ID=With <code>1</code> the id was added in the Message-ID header, with <code>2</code> it was also appended to the sender address (name+trackid@domain).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EMAIL_SUPPORT_ACK=Show the "Delivery receipt" option in email sending forms
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EMAIL_SUPPORT_ACK=Hidden by default since most mail clients ignore delivery receipt requests.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EMAIL_USECCC=Show a Bcc field in email sending forms
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EMAIL_USECCC=Set to <code>1</code> to show an empty field, or to an email address to show the field prefilled with it.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EMAIL_USE_LAYOUT=Offer predefined layouts in the email form
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EMAIL_USE_LAYOUT=Enabled by default, available with the WYSIWYG editor. Set 0 to hide them.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EXTERNAL_SMTP_CLIENT_IP_ADDRESS=IP addresses of the servers sending the emails, shown in the email setup page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EXTERNAL_SMTP_CLIENT_IP_ADDRESS=Comma separated list of IPs or of URLs returning the public IP. Used to help users set their SPF record (PHP mail method) or their SMTP IP restrictions. Useful for hosting providers.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FIX_FOR_BUGGED_MTA=Use LF only line endings in emails, for mail servers that add CR
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FIX_FOR_BUGGED_MTA=Enabled by default. Some mail servers add a CR before each LF and break RFC compliant emails, so Dolibarr writes LF only. Set 0 if your recipients get broken emails (reported with Exim).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_IMAP_USE_PHPIMAP=Use the embedded PHP-IMAP library instead of the native PHP imap extension for email collectors
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_INFO_SOCIETE_MAIL_ALIASES=Additional sender addresses proposed in the "From" list of email forms
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_INFO_SOCIETE_MAIL_ALIASES=Comma separated list of addresses, each one as <code>Name &lt;email&gt;</code> or just an email.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAILFORM_DISABLE_ENTERKEY=Disable the Enter key in email forms
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAILFORM_DISABLE_ENTERKEY=Avoids sending the email by mistake.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_ADD_INLINE_IMAGES_IF_IN_MEDIAS=Embed images stored in the medias directory as inline content in sent emails
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_ADD_INLINE_IMAGES_IF_IN_MEDIAS=Emails become heavier and are more likely to be flagged as spam.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_ALLOW_SENDMAIL_F=Pass the sender to sendmail with the -f option
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_ALLOW_SENDMAIL_F=Only for the PHP mail sending method. Use it when your sendmail ignores the From header or requires the -f option.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_AUTOCOPY_PROPOSAL_TO=Always add this address in Bcc when sending a commercial proposal by email
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_AUTOCOPY_PROPOSAL_TO=Same logic exists for other objects with <code>MAIN_MAIL_AUTOCOPY_ORDER_TO</code>, <code>MAIN_MAIL_AUTOCOPY_INVOICE_TO</code>, <code>MAIN_MAIL_AUTOCOPY_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_TO</code>, etc. The address is shown in the form only if <code>MAIN_EMAIL_USECCC</code> is set.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG=Save the last email sent into a debug file
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG=Headers and content are written into <code>dolibarr_mail.log</code> in the documents directory, overwritten at each sending. On error the file is moved to <code>dolibarr_mail.err</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG_ERR_WITH_DATE=Keep one error file per failed email, named with the date
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG_ERR_WITH_DATE=With <code>MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG</code>, each failed email is saved in a <code>dolibarr_mail.*.err</code> file named with date and time, instead of overwriting <code>dolibarr_mail.err</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG_LOG_WITH_DATE=Keep previous versions of the email debug file
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG_LOG_WITH_DATE=With <code>MAIN_MAIL_DEBUG</code>, each <code>dolibarr_mail.log</code> is archived as a versioned copy. The value is the number of copies to keep.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_DO_NOT_USE_SIGN=Do not add the user signature to emails
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_DO_NOT_USE_SIGN=The user and sender profile signature keys stay empty in email templates and mass mailings.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_ENABLED_USER_DEST_SELECT=Also propose internal users as recipients in email sending forms
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_FORCE_CONTENT_TYPE_TO_HTML=Always send emails in HTML format, even when the content is plain text
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_FORCE_FROM=Force the From address of all emails sent
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_FORCE_FROM=When no reply address is given, the original sender is kept as Reply-To.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_FORCE_NOT_SENDING_TO=Email addresses that never receive any email
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_FORCE_NOT_SENDING_TO=Comma separated list. These addresses are removed from To, Cc and Bcc before sending.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_NO_FULL_EMAIL=Use bare email addresses, without the name, for sender and recipients
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_NO_FULL_EMAIL=May help with very old mail servers.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_SENDMAIL_FORCE_BA=Call sendmail with the -ba option
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MAIL_SENDMAIL_FORCE_BA=Only for the PHP mail sending method: sendmail then reads the sender from the From or Sender header. Setting <code>mail.force_extra_parameters</code> in php.ini is an alternative.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MAIL_USE_MULTI_PART=Build emails with an alternative plain text part
HiddenConfWarning_MAIN_MAIL_USE_MULTI_PART=No effect: the application always forces this option to 1.

# Emailing Module
HiddenConfTitle_EMAILING_USE_ADVANCED_SELECTOR=Use the advanced recipient selector in emailings
HiddenConfDesc_EMAILING_USE_ADVANCED_SELECTOR=Automatically enabled when JavaScript is on and <code>MAIN_FEATURES_LEVEL</code> is 1 or more.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_LIMIT_SENDBYCLI=Maximum number of emails sent in one run of the emailing command line script
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_LIMIT_SENDBYCLI=<code>0</code> or not set means no limit, <code>-1</code> forbids sending from the command line. The value <code>$dolibarr_mailing_limit_sendbycli</code> of conf.php overrides it.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_LIMIT_SENDBYWEB=Maximum number of emails sent in one emailing batch from the web interface
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_LIMIT_SENDBYWEB=Default is <code>25</code>. The value <code>$dolibarr_mailing_limit_sendbyweb</code> of conf.php overrides it.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_LIMIT_WARNING_NOPHPMAIL=Warning shown on emailing sending when a method other than PHP mail is used
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_LIMIT_WARNING_NOPHPMAIL=Value is a translation key or a plain text message.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_LIMIT_WARNING_PHPMAIL=Warning shown on emailing sending when the PHP mail method is used
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_LIMIT_WARNING_PHPMAIL=Value is a translation key or a plain text message.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_NO_USING_PHPMAIL=Forbid sending emailings with the PHP mail method (an SMTP server is required)
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_NO_USING_PHPMAIL=The error message can include a contact address set with <code>MAILING_SMTP_SETUP_EMAILS_FOR_QUESTIONS</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_PREFIX_FOR_EMAIL_ID=Prefix used to build the email id in headers of emailings (removed)
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_PREFIX_FOR_EMAIL_ID=Replaced by <code>MAIL_PREFIX_FOR_EMAIL_ID</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_SMTP_SETUP_EMAILS_FOR_QUESTIONS=Contact address shown when emailings are refused because no SMTP server is set
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_SMTP_SETUP_EMAILS_FOR_QUESTIONS=Only used with <code>MAILING_NO_USING_PHPMAIL</code>.

# Expense Report
HiddenConfTitle_EXPENSEREPORT_ALLOW_OVERLAPPING_PERIODS=Allow several expense reports of the same user on overlapping periods
HiddenConfTitle_EXPENSEREPORT_OVERRIDE_VAT=Allow VAT selection on expense reports even if the company is not subject to VAT
HiddenConfTitle_EXPENSEREPORT_USE_OLD_NUMBERING_RULE=Use the old fixed numbering of expense reports (before v7) with the default numbering model
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_EXPENSE_IK=Enable mileage allowances (vehicle categories and kilometric scales) on expense reports
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_EXPENSE_RULE=Enable expense report rules limiting amounts per user or group (removed)

# Export Module
HiddenConfTitle_EXPORTS_SHARE_MODELS=Share export profiles between all users
HiddenConfTitle_EXPORTTOOL_CATEGORIES=Add the tags/categories of products and services as a column in their export profiles
HiddenConfTitle_EXPORT_CSV_FORCE_CHARSET=Character set used for CSV content
HiddenConfDesc_EXPORT_CSV_FORCE_CHARSET=Only used by CSV files built outside the Export module, for example the export of the unalterable log archives.
HiddenConfWarning_EXPORT_CSV_FORCE_CHARSET=No effect in the Export module: its CSV formats force their own character set (ISO-8859-1 or UTF-8).
HiddenConfTitle_EXPORT_CSV_SEPARATOR_TO_USE=Field separator used in CSV exports
HiddenConfDesc_EXPORT_CSV_SEPARATOR_TO_USE=Default is a comma.
HiddenConfTitle_USE_STRICT_CSV_RULES=How line breaks inside values are written in CSV exports
HiddenConfDesc_USE_STRICT_CSV_RULES=<code>2</code> (default): line breaks replaced by <code>\n</code> and value quoted. <code>1</code>: line breaks kept as is and value quoted (strict CSV). <code>0</code>: line breaks replaced by <code>\n</code> without quotes.

# Foundation Module
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_EXT_URL_SUBSCRIPTION_INFO=URL of an external page with membership information, linked from the public subscription and payment pages
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_URL_REDIRECT_SUBSCRIPTION=URL to redirect to after the public member (or third party) registration form is submitted
HiddenConfDesc_MEMBER_URL_REDIRECT_SUBSCRIPTION=Not used when the visitor is sent to the online payment page.

# Holiday Module
HiddenConfTitle_HOLIDAY_HIDE_BALANCE=Hide the leave balance on the leave request card and on the HRM home page
HiddenConfDesc_HOLIDAY_HIDE_BALANCE=Set to <code>1</code>, or to a translation key or text to show that message instead of the balance.

# Interventions Module
HiddenConfTitle_FICHINTER_CLASSIFY_BILLED=Allow classifying interventions as "Billed"
HiddenConfDesc_FICHINTER_CLASSIFY_BILLED=Adds the buttons on the card, the status in lists and statistics, and the related agenda event.
HiddenConfTitle_FICHINTER_DISABLE_DETAILS=Disable the detail lines of interventions
HiddenConfDesc_FICHINTER_DISABLE_DETAILS=<code>1</code>: no lines on the card, an intervention can be validated without lines. <code>2</code>: lines kept on the card but line columns hidden in the list.

# Invoice Module
HiddenConfTitle_FACTUREFOURN_REUSE_NOTES_ON_CREATE_FROM=Copy the public and private notes of the origin object when creating a supplier invoice from it
HiddenConfTitle_FACTURE_DEPOSITS_ARE_JUST_PAYMENTS=Handle deposit invoices as simple payments on the final invoice (not recommended)
HiddenConfDesc_FACTURE_DEPOSITS_ARE_JUST_PAYMENTS=The final invoice amount is not reduced, a payment is recorded instead and the deposit is not counted in turnover. Not allowed in many European countries.
HiddenConfTitle_FACTURE_ENABLE_NEGATIVE=Allow validating a customer invoice with a negative total
HiddenConfTitle_FACTURE_ENABLE_NEGATIVE_LINES=Allow adding lines with a negative amount on customer invoices
HiddenConfTitle_FACTURE_REUSE_NOTES_ON_CREATE_FROM=Copy the public and private notes of the origin object when creating a customer invoice from it
HiddenConfTitle_FACTURE_SENDBYEMAIL_FOR_ALL_STATUS=Allow sending draft invoices by email
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICEREC_SET_AUTOFILL_DATE_START=Set "Auto fill start date" to yes for lines of a template invoice created from an invoice
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICEREC_SET_AUTOFILL_DATE_START=Use <code>INVOICEREC_SET_AUTOFILL_DATE_END</code> for the end date.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=Create a public share link for each generated invoice PDF
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=The link can be inserted in email templates with <code>__DIRECTDOWNLOAD_URL_INVOICE__</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_ALLOW_FREE_REF=Allow changing the ref of a draft invoice
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_ALLOW_FREE_REF=Only available when the company is located outside the European Union.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_ALLOW_REUSE_OF_CREDIT_WHEN_PARTIALLY_REFUNDED=Allow converting the remainder of a partially refunded credit note into a reusable discount
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_AUTO_NEXT_MONTH_ON_LINES=When cloning an invoice, shift service lines covering a full month to the next month
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_AUTO_NEXT_MONTH_ON_LINES=Only for lines whose period starts on the first day and ends on the last day of a month.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_CAN_ALWAYS_BE_REMOVED=Allow deleting any invoice, even if it is not the last one (removed)
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_CAN_BE_EDITED_EVEN_IF_PAYMENT_DONE=Allow modifying a validated invoice even if a payment was recorded
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_CAN_BE_EDITED_EVEN_IF_PAYMENT_DONE=Records already archived by the Unalterable logs module are not changed, a new log entry is added.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_CAN_NEVER_BE_EDITED=Never allow putting a validated invoice back to draft
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_CAN_NEVER_BE_EDITED=See also <code>INVOICE_CAN_NEVER_BE_REMOVED</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_CAN_NEVER_BE_REMOVED=Never allow deleting an invoice, except drafts with a temporary (PROV) ref
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_CAN_NEVER_BE_REMOVED=See also <code>INVOICE_CAN_NEVER_BE_EDITED</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_CREDIT_NOTE_STANDALONE=Allow creating a credit note not linked to an origin invoice
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_CREDIT_NOTE_STANDALONE=Enabled by default when the company country is Greece.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_DEFAULT_NOTE_PUBLIC=Default public note of new invoices (removed)
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_DISABLE_CREDIT_NOTE=Disable the credit note invoice type
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_DISABLE_DEPOSIT=Disable the deposit invoice type
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_DISABLE_DEPOSIT=Enabled by default when the company country is Greece.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_DISABLE_REPLACEMENT=Disable the replacement invoice type
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_DISABLE_REPLACEMENT=Enabled by default when the company country is France or Greece. Set to <code>0</code> to allow replacement invoices there.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_DISALLOW_REOPEN=Forbid reopening paid or abandoned customer invoices
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_KEEP_DISCOUNT_LINES_AS_IN_ORIGIN=Keep lines with a negative price as they are instead of converting them into discounts when creating an invoice
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_KEEP_DISCOUNT_LINES_AS_IN_ORIGIN=For credit notes, also requires <code>FACTURE_ENABLE_NEGATIVE_LINES</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_MAX_FUTURE_DELAY=Tolerance in seconds for invoice dates in the future
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_MAX_FUTURE_DELAY=By default an invoice dated after the end of the current day is refused. Applies to customer and supplier invoices.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_POINTOFTAX_DATE=Add a "Point of tax" date on invoices
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_POINTOFTAX_DATE=Required in some countries. The date is printed on invoice PDF.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_POSITIVE_CREDIT_NOTE=Show amounts of credit notes as positive values on PDF
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_REC_DATE_TO_YES=Preselect yes for the auto fill of start and end dates in the line form of template invoices
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_SUBTYPE_ENABLED=Enable invoice subtypes (from the "Invoice subtypes" dictionary)
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_SUBTYPE_ENABLED=Required in some countries, enabled by default for Greece. A subtype becomes mandatory on invoice creation.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_USE_DEFAULT_DOCUMENT=Allow a default PDF model per invoice type
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_USE_DEFAULT_DOCUMENT=Models are chosen in the invoice setup and the model is selected automatically when the invoice type is chosen on creation.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_USE_RETAINED_WARRANTY=Enable retained warranty on invoices
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_USE_RETAINED_WARRANTY=Also available in the "Situation invoices" tab of the invoice setup when situation invoices are enabled.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_USE_SITUATION=Enable situation invoices
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_USE_SITUATION=<code>1</code>: legacy cumulative mode (known bugs, not compatible with double-entry accounting). <code>2</code>: new progressive mode. Once enabled, a "Situation invoices" tab in the invoice setup allows changing the mode.
HiddenConfTitle_INVOICE_USE_SITUATION_CREDIT_NOTE=Allow credit notes on situation invoices
HiddenConfDesc_INVOICE_USE_SITUATION_CREDIT_NOTE=Requires <code>INVOICE_USE_SITUATION</code>. Also available in the "Situation invoices" tab of the invoice setup.
HiddenConfTitle_LIST_OF_QUALIFIED_INVOICES_LIMIT_DEFINED=Limit the number of invoices proposed as source when creating a credit note
HiddenConfDesc_LIST_OF_QUALIFIED_INVOICES_LIMIT_DEFINED=Improves performance for customers with many invoices (for example with TakePOS).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DEPOSIT_MULTI_TVA=Create one line per VAT rate of the origin document when creating a deposit invoice
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DEPOSIT_MULTI_TVA=Also applies to supplier invoices and to the deduction of the deposit on the final invoice.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_DOCUMENTS_WITHOUT_VAT=Hide all VAT information on generated PDF documents
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_DOCUMENTS_WITHOUT_VAT_COLUMN=Hide the VAT column of lines on generated PDF documents, keeping VAT totals
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SHOW_FACNUMBER_IN_DISCOUNT_LIST=Show the source invoice ref in the list of available discounts
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_INVOICE_SHOW_PRICE_INCL_TAX=Add a column with the unit price including tax on invoice PDF (sponge model)
HiddenConfTitle_SUPPLIER_INVOICE_ALLOW_REUSE_OF_CREDIT_WHEN_PARTIALLY_REFUNDED=Allow converting the remainder of a partially refunded supplier credit note into a reusable discount
HiddenConfTitle_SUPPLIER_INVOICE_ENABLE_NEGATIVE=Allow validating a supplier invoice with a negative total
HiddenConfTitle_SUPPLIER_INVOICE_ENABLE_NEGATIVE_LINES=Allow adding lines with a negative amount on supplier invoices
HiddenConfTitle_WORKFLOW_BILL_ON_SHIPMENT=Choose whether billing status is tracked on orders or on shipments
HiddenConfDesc_WORKFLOW_BILL_ON_SHIPMENT=<code>1</code>: billing is done from shipments, the "Billed" column and classify billed buttons of orders are hidden. <code>0</code>: billing status of shipments is hidden. Not set: both are available.

# Leave
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NON_WORKING_DAYS_INCLUDE_SATURDAY=Count Saturday as a non working day
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NON_WORKING_DAYS_INCLUDE_SATURDAY=Default is <code>1</code>. Set to <code>0</code> to make Saturday a working day in leave and delay calculations.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NON_WORKING_DAYS_INCLUDE_SUNDAY=Count Sunday as a non working day
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NON_WORKING_DAYS_INCLUDE_SUNDAY=Default is <code>1</code>. Set to <code>0</code> to make Sunday a working day in leave and delay calculations.

# Look or Theme
HiddenConfTitle_ALLOW_THEME_JS=Load a custom JavaScript file from the theme folder
HiddenConfDesc_ALLOW_THEME_JS=When set, the file <code>theme/THEME/THEME.js</code> (same name as the active theme folder) is included in every page if it exists.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_GLOBAL_BOXSTATS=Hide the global statistics board on the home page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_GLOBAL_BOXSTATS=The "Dolibarr state board" widget no longer shows its counters.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_GLOBAL_WORKBOARD=Hide the work board on the home page
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EASTER_EGG_COMMITSTRIP=Show the latest CommitStrip comic on the login page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EASTER_EGG_COMMITSTRIP=The server must be able to reach commitstrip.com.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FAVICON_URL=URL of a custom favicon
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_INCLUDE_GLOBAL_STATS_IN_OPENED_DASHBOARD=Always show the statistic labels of the "open elements" dashboard boxes, not only on hover
HiddenConfTitle_THEME_AGRESSIVENESS_RATIO=Color intensity of the theme (removed)
HiddenConfDesc_THEME_AGRESSIVENESS_RATIO=From <code>-100</code> (light grey) to <code>100</code> (very bright), <code>0</code> being the default.
HiddenConfTitle_THEME_SHOW_BORDER_ON_INPUT=Show a border around input fields
HiddenConfDesc_THEME_SHOW_BORDER_ON_INPUT=On by default, set to <code>0</code> to hide borders. Also available in the theme setup.

# Manifest (Progressive Web App)
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_BG_COLOR=Background color of the web app manifest (PWA)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_BG_COLOR=Color code used as <code>background_color</code>. Default is #ffffff.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_LOGO_URL=Icon URL declared in the web app manifest (PWA)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_LOGO_URL=When set, this image URL is added as an icon of the manifest. Use <code>MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_LOGO_URL_SIZE</code> to declare its size.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_LOGO_URL_SIZE=Size in pixels of the custom manifest icon (PWA)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_LOGO_URL_SIZE=A single number, declared as a square size (for example 512 gives 512x512). Only used with <code>MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_LOGO_URL</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_THEME_COLOR=Theme color of the web app manifest (PWA)
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MANIFEST_APPLI_THEME_COLOR=Color code used as <code>theme_color</code>. Defaults to the top menu color of the Eldy theme, or #F05F40.

# Order Module
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MASSACTION_CREATEBILLS_REDIRECT_IF_MANY=Go to the invoice list when the "Create invoices" mass action creates several
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MASSACTION_CREATEBILLS_REDIRECT_IF_MANY=Applies to the mass action of the sales order list.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_MASSACTION_CREATEBILLS_REDIRECT_IF_ONE=Open the invoice when the "Create invoices" mass action creates only one
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_MASSACTION_CREATEBILLS_REDIRECT_IF_ONE=Applies to the mass action of the sales order list.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ORDERLIST_CREATEBILLS_ONEBYTHIRD=Default value of "One invoice per third party" when creating invoices from orders
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ORDERLIST_CREATEBILLS_ONEBYTHIRD=Used as preselected choice in the mass action form of the sales order list: <code>yes</code> or <code>no</code> (default <code>no</code>).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_REMOVE_DROPDOWN_CREATE_BUTTONS_ON_ORDER=Use separate "Create" buttons instead of a dropdown on order and proposal cards
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_REMOVE_DROPDOWN_CREATE_BUTTONS_ON_ORDER=Restores the button layout used before the dropdown introduced in version 19.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_PROPAL_REFCLIENT_FOR_ORDER=Show the customer reference of the proposal when creating an order from it
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_PROPAL_REFCLIENT_FOR_ORDER=On the order creation form, a field prefilled with the proposal customer reference is shown so it is copied to the order.
HiddenConfTitle_ORDER_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=Add a public share link to generated sales order documents
HiddenConfDesc_ORDER_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=Each generated PDF gets a share key so it can be downloaded without login.
HiddenConfTitle_ORDER_DEFAULT_NOTE_PUBLIC=Default text of the public note of sales orders
HiddenConfTitle_ORDER_ENABLE_NEGATIVE=Allow validating sales orders with a negative total
HiddenConfDesc_ORDER_ENABLE_NEGATIVE=The Validate button is shown even when the total including tax is below zero.
HiddenConfTitle_ORDER_REQUIRE_SOURCE=Make the "Source" field mandatory on sales orders
HiddenConfDesc_ORDER_REQUIRE_SOURCE=The order cannot be created when no source (channel) is selected.
HiddenConfTitle_ORDER_VALID_AFTER_CLOSE_PROPAL=Validate immediately the order created when a proposal is signed
HiddenConfDesc_ORDER_VALID_AFTER_CLOSE_PROPAL=The order generated automatically on proposal closing is validated right away instead of staying draft.
HiddenConfTitle_THIRDPARTY_PROPAGATE_EXTRAFIELDS_TO_ORDER=Copy third party extra fields to new sales orders
HiddenConfDesc_THIRDPARTY_PROPAGATE_EXTRAFIELDS_TO_ORDER=Only extra fields with the same code on both objects are copied.

# PDF Options
HiddenConfTitle_DOC_SHOW_FIRST_SALES_REP=Show the first sales representative in the PDF header
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ADD_PDF_BACKGROUND=Use a PDF file as background of generated PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ADD_PDF_BACKGROUND=File name of a PDF stored in <code>documents/mycompany</code>. Its first page is imported under the content of supported templates (proposals, orders, invoices, etc.). Value <code>-1</code> disables it.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_FORCE_SAVEAS=Open downloaded documents in the browser instead of forcing a download
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_FORCE_SAVEAS=<code>1</code>: the file is displayed in the current tab when the browser can. <code>2</code>: same, and document links open in a new tab.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_PDF_AUTOUPDATE=Do not regenerate the PDF automatically after each change
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_PDF_AUTOUPDATE=By default the document is rebuilt when lines are added, edited, moved or deleted, or on validation. With this option, use the "Generate" button. Can speed up slow servers.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_PDF_COMPRESSION=Disable compression of generated PDF files
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_PDF_COMPRESSION=Produces larger files, mainly useful for debugging.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_COMMANDE=Hide product descriptions on sales order PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_COMMANDE=Only the product reference and label are kept.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_FACTURE=Hide product descriptions on customer invoice PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_FACTURE=Only the product reference and label are kept.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_INVOICE_SUPPLIER=Hide product descriptions on vendor invoice PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_INVOICE_SUPPLIER=Only the product reference and label are kept.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_ORDER_SUPPLIER=Hide product descriptions on purchase order PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_HIDE_DESCRIPTION_FOR_ORDER_SUPPLIER=Only the product reference and label are kept.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_WITH_PICTURE_WIDTH=Width of product pictures in PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DOCUMENTS_WITH_PICTURE_WIDTH=Width in mm of the picture column when product pictures are enabled on PDF. Default is 20.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_DOCUMENTS_SHOW_FOOT_DETAILS=Show the company address details in the PDF footer
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_INVOICES_WITH_PICTURE=Show the product picture on lines of customer invoice PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_GENERATE_INVOICES_WITH_PICTURE=The first picture of the product is used.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_ORDERS_WITH_PICTURE=Show the product picture on lines of sales order PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_GENERATE_ORDERS_WITH_PICTURE=The first picture of the product is used.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_PROPOSALS_WITH_PICTURE=Show the product picture on lines of commercial proposal PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_GENERATE_PROPOSALS_WITH_PICTURE=The first picture of the product is used. It reduces the width left for the description.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_SUPPLIER_ORDER_WITH_PICTURE=Show the product picture on lines of purchase order PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_GENERATE_SUPPLIER_ORDER_WITH_PICTURE=The first picture of the product is used (Cornas template).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_GENERATE_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_WITH_PICTURE=Show the product picture on lines of price request PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_GENERATE_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_WITH_PICTURE=The first picture of the product is used (Zenith template).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_INVERT_SENDER_RECIPIENT=Swap the sender and recipient blocks on PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_INVERT_SENDER_RECIPIENT=Enabled automatically when the company country is Germany, unless the constant is defined.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF=Convert documents generated from ODT templates into PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF=Value <code>libreoffice</code> uses the <code>soffice</code> command that must be installed on the server. Value <code>jodconverter</code> is deprecated.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF_DEL_SOURCE=Delete the ODT file after its conversion into PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ODT_AS_PDF_DEL_SOURCE=Only used with ODT to PDF conversion enabled.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_ADDALSOTARGETDETAILS=Add the recipient phone, fax, email and website in PDF addresses
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_ADDALSOTARGETDETAILS=Useful when a printed document is handed to a carrier.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_DASH_BETWEEN_LINES=Draw a dashed separator between lines of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_DASH_BETWEEN_LINES=Enabled by default when the constant is not defined. Set it to 0 to remove the separators.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_DONOTREPEAT_HEAD=Do not repeat the document header on following PDF pages
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_DONOTREPEAT_HEAD=Supported by some templates (contracts, projects, etc.).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT=Force the font used in PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT=Overrides the font defined by the language files. The font must be known by TCPDF.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT_SIZE=Force the base font size of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_FORCE_FONT_SIZE=Overrides the size defined by the language files (usually 10).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_FREETEXT_HEIGHT=Height reserved for the free text at the bottom of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_FREETEXT_HEIGHT=Value in mm, default is 5. Increase it when a long free text overlaps the content.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_HIDE_SENDER_NAME=Hide your company name in the sender block of PDF documents
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_NO_RECIPENT_FRAME=Remove the recipient frame and its "Bill to" label on PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_NO_RECIPENT_FRAME=The recipient address is still printed, without the border.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_NO_SENDER_FRAME=Remove the sender frame and its "Sender" label on PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_NO_SENDER_FRAME=The sender address is still printed, without the grey background box.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_PROPAL_USE_ELECTRONIC_SIGNING=Add a signature area to commercial proposal PDF
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_PROPAL_USE_ELECTRONIC_SIGNING=Enabled by default when the constant is not defined (Cyan template).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_TITLE_BACKGROUND_COLOR=Background color of the title line of PDF tables
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_TITLE_BACKGROUND_COLOR=RGB values separated by commas.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PDF_USE_LARGE_LOGO=Use the full size company logo in PDF instead of the small one
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PDF_USE_LARGE_LOGO=Gives a sharper logo but the PDF files can become very large.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROFID1_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your professional ID 1 in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROFID1_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Only when this ID is filled in the company setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROFID2_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your professional ID 2 in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROFID2_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Only when this ID is filled in the company setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROFID3_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your professional ID 3 in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROFID3_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Only when this ID is filled in the company setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROFID4_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your professional ID 4 in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROFID4_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Only when this ID is filled in the company setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROFID5_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your professional ID 5 in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROFID5_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Only when this ID is filled in the company setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PROFID6_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your professional ID 6 in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PROFID6_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Only when this ID is filled in the company setup.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_TVAINTRA_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Show your VAT number in the sender address of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_TVAINTRA_IN_SOURCE_ADDRESS=Required in some countries even if the number is already in the footer.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_BACKGROUND_ON_PDF=Use an image as background of generated PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_BACKGROUND_ON_PDF=File name of an image stored in <code>documents/mycompany/logos</code>. Value <code>-1</code> disables it. May hide some content of the page.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_USE_COMPANY_NAME_OF_CONTACT=Use the company of the recipient contact in PDF addresses
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_USE_COMPANY_NAME_OF_CONTACT=When the recipient contact belongs to another third party than the document one, its company name (and VAT number) is shown. Most templates do this when the constant is not defined, set it to 0 to disable.
HiddenConfTitle_MULTICURRENCY_SHOW_ALSO_MAIN_CURRENCY_ON_PDF=Show totals in both currencies on PDF with Multicurrency
HiddenConfDesc_MULTICURRENCY_SHOW_ALSO_MAIN_CURRENCY_ON_PDF=When the document uses a foreign currency, amounts in the main currency are also shown.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_ADD_POSITION=Add a line number column in PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_ADD_POSITION=Supported by recent templates (invoices, orders, shipments, purchase orders, interventions). Some templates also have their own constant, like <code>PDF_SPONGE_ADD_POSITION</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_BANK_HIDE_NUMBER_SHOW_ONLY_BICIBAN=Show only BIC and IBAN in bank details of PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_BANK_HIDE_NUMBER_SHOW_ONLY_BICIBAN=The national account number (bank code, sort code, etc.) is hidden. Some countries still require it.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_BOLD_PRODUCT_REF_AND_PERIOD=Show the product reference and service period in bold on PDF lines
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_HIDE_PRODUCT_LABEL_IN_SUPPLIER_LINES=Hide the product label on PDF lines
HiddenConfWarning_PDF_HIDE_PRODUCT_LABEL_IN_SUPPLIER_LINES=Misleading name: the label is hidden on the lines of all PDF documents, not only supplier ones.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_HIDE_PRODUCT_REF_IN_SUPPLIER_LINES=Change how product references are shown on supplier PDF lines
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_HIDE_PRODUCT_REF_IN_SUPPLIER_LINES=<code>1</code>: show only the supplier reference. <code>2</code>: show the supplier reference followed by the internal reference. By default the internal reference comes first.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_INCLUDE_ALIAS_IN_THIRDPARTY_NAME=Add the third party alias name to its name on PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_INCLUDE_ALIAS_IN_THIRDPARTY_NAME=<code>1</code>: name then alias. <code>2</code>: alias then name.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_ORDER_SHOW_PRICE_INCL_TAX=Add a unit price including tax column on sales order PDF
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_ORDER_SHOW_PRICE_INCL_TAX=Eratosthene template.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_PROPAL_SHOW_PRICE_INCL_TAX=Add a unit price including tax column on proposal PDF
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_PROPAL_SHOW_PRICE_INCL_TAX=Cyan template.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION=Encrypt and protect generated PDF files
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION=Options: <code>PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION_RIGHTS</code> (JSON list of blocked rights, default ["modify","copy"]), <code>PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION_USERPASS</code>, <code>PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION_OWNERPASS</code> (random if empty), <code>PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION_STRENGTH</code> (0 RC4 40 bit to 3 AES 256 bit).
HiddenConfWarning_PDF_SECURITY_ENCRYPTION=Not supported: the PDF setup page warns that it breaks several PDF features, such as mass PDF generation and online signature.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_SHOW_PROJECT=Show the linked project on PDF documents
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_SHOW_PROJECT=Supported by several templates (invoices, orders, purchase orders, supplier invoices, assets).
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_USE_ALSO_LANGUAGE_CODE=Generate PDF documents in a second language as well
HiddenConfDesc_PDF_USE_ALSO_LANGUAGE_CODE=Language code added to the main language of the document, so texts appear in both.
HiddenConfTitle_PDF_USE_GETALIASNBPAGE_FOR_TOTAL=Use the TCPDF page count alias for the total number of pages
HiddenConfTitle_SHIPPING_PDF_DISPLAY_AMOUNT_HT=Show unit price and total excluding tax on shipment PDF
HiddenConfDesc_SHIPPING_PDF_DISPLAY_AMOUNT_HT=Espadon template.
HiddenConfTitle_SHOW_SUBPRODUCT_REF_IN_PDF=Show the references of kit components on PDF lines

# Point of Sale (POS)
HiddenConfTitle_CASHDESK_SHOW_KEYPAD=Show a numeric keypad in the former Simple POS module
HiddenConfTitle_POS_ADDON=Numbering model of invoices created by the point of sale
HiddenConfDesc_POS_ADDON=Name of an invoice numbering model.
HiddenConfTitle_TAKEPOS_CAN_FORCE_BANK_ACCOUNT_DURING_PAYMENT=Allow choosing the bank account during a TakePOS payment
HiddenConfTitle_TAKEPOS_CONTROL_CASH_OPENING=Ask for the cash fund when opening TakePOS
HiddenConfTitle_TAKEPOS_ENABLE_SUMUP=Enable SumUp card terminal support in TakePOS
HiddenConfDesc_TAKEPOS_ENABLE_SUMUP=Adds the SumUp settings in TakePOS setup and terminals, and a SumUp payment button.
HiddenConfTitle_TAKEPOS_NUMPAD_FORCE_PAYMENT_ICONS_LABELS=Show payment method labels with icons on the TakePOS keypad

# Products Module
HiddenConfTitle_CATEGORY_GRAPHSTATS_ON_PRODUCTS=Show a chart of products per category on the Products area page
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DIRECT_STATUS_UPDATE=Change status with an on/off switch directly on cards
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DIRECT_STATUS_UPDATE=Applies to product sell and buy status (card and list) and to third party status, for users allowed to edit them.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_DISABLE_FREE_LINES=Forbid free lines (without product) in documents
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_DISABLE_FREE_LINES=Only lines linked to a product or service can be added.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EDIT_LINE_ALLOW_ALL_UNIT_TYPE=Allow any unit type when editing a document line
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EDIT_LINE_ALLOW_ALL_UNIT_TYPE=By default, when a line already has a unit, only units of the same type (weight, length, etc.) are offered.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_PRODUCT_DISABLE_CUSTOMCOUNTRYCODE=Do not add customs code and country of origin to line descriptions
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_PRODUCT_DISABLE_CUSTOMCOUNTRYCODE=By default they are appended to the description when a product is added to a proposal, order, invoice or reception.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SEARCH_PRODUCT_BY_FOURN_REF=Also search products by supplier reference in product selectors
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SHOW_PRODUCT_ACTIVITY_TRIM=Show quarterly turnover per product type on the Products area page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SHOW_PRODUCT_ACTIVITY_TRIM=Requires the Invoices module and read permission on invoices.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_ADD_FORM_ADD_TO=Show forms on the product card to add the product to a draft proposal, order or invoice
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_ADD_NET_MEASURE=Add a net measure field (net weight, volume or pieces) on the product card
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_ADD_NET_MEASURE=Useful when two values are needed for each product, for example gross and net weight.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_ADD_TYPE_IN_DOCUMENTS=Prefix document lines with "Product" or "Service"
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DENY_CHANGE_PRODUCT_TYPE=Prevent changing the type (product or service) of an existing product
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DENY_CHANGE_PRODUCT_TYPE=The type is shown read only on the price and variant pages.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_ACCOUNTING=Hide the accounting account fields on the product card
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_ACCOUNTING=The accounting code columns are also removed from the product list.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_CUSTOM_INFO=Hide the customs information (customs code, country of origin) on products (old versions)
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_CUSTOM_INFO=Removed in version 22.0.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_EATBY=Hide the eat-by date when dispatching received products
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_LENGTH=Hide the length field on the product card (old versions)
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_LENGTH=Removed in version 6.0, replaced by <code>PRODUCT_DISABLE_SIZE</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_NATURE=Hide the product nature field on the product card
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_NATURE=Applies to the create, edit and view modes of the product card and to the kit composition page.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_PRICES=Hide the price fields in the product creation form
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_PROPAGATE_CUSTOMER_PRICES_ON_CHILD_COMPANIES=Do not copy customer prices to subsidiaries of the customer
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_PROPAGATE_CUSTOMER_PRICES_ON_CHILD_COMPANIES=By default, creating or deleting a customer specific price also applies it to third parties whose parent is this customer.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_PUBLIC_URL=Hide the "Public URL" field on product cards
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_SELLBY=Hide the sell-by date when dispatching received products
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_SIZE=Hide the size fields (length, width, height) on the product card
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_SIZE=The length columns are also removed from the product list.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_STOCK_LEVELS=Hide the stock alert limit and desired stock fields on the product card
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_SURFACE=Hide the surface field on the product card
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_VOLUME=Hide the volume field on the product card
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DISABLE_VOLUME=The volume columns are also removed from the product list.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DISABLE_WEIGHT=Hide the weight field on the product card
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_DONOTSEARCH_ANYWHERE=Search products only from the start of the reference or label
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_DONOTSEARCH_ANYWHERE=Much faster on large catalogs because database indexes can be used.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_LOAD_EXTRAFIELD_INTO_OBJECTLINES=Copy the product extra field values into the line extra fields when a product is selected
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_LOAD_EXTRAFIELD_INTO_OBJECTLINES=Only extra fields with the same code on the product and on the line are filled, in the add line form.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_LOT_ENABLE_QUALITY_CONTROL=Show the lifetime and quality control fields on products and lots
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_LOT_ENABLE_QUALITY_CONTROL=Adds the lifetime and quality control frequency fields on the product card and the related dates on the lot card.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_MAX_LENGTH_COMBO=Maximum length of the product label shown in the product selection list
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_MAX_LENGTH_COMBO=Number of characters kept for the label when adding lines to documents. Default: 48.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_MAX_VISIBLE_PHOTO=Maximum number of photos shown in the header of the product card
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_MAX_VISIBLE_PHOTO=Default: 5. On phone layout only one photo is shown.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_PRICE_BASE_TYPE=Default price base (excluding or including tax) for new products
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_PRICE_BASE_TYPE=Accepted values: <code>HT</code> (excluding tax) or <code>TTC</code> (including tax).
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_SEARCH_AUTO_SELECT_IF_ONLY_ONE=Automatically select the product when the search returns a single result
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_SEARCH_AUTO_SELECT_IF_ONLY_ONE=Enabled by default. Set to <code>0</code> to disable it in the product search fields.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_SHOW_ORIGIN_IN_COMBO=Show the country of origin of products in the product selection list
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_SORT_BY_CATEGORY=Sort the product selection list by category instead of by reference
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_SORT_BY_CATEGORY=1 sorts categories in ascending order, any other value in descending order.
HiddenConfWarning_PRODUCT_SORT_BY_CATEGORY=Bug flagged in the code: when a product is in several categories, the one used for sorting is picked arbitrarily.
HiddenConfTitle_PRODUCT_USE_OLD_PATH_FOR_PHOTO=Also look for product photos in the old storage path (before 3.7)
HiddenConfDesc_PRODUCT_USE_OLD_PATH_FOR_PHOTO=Only useful for old installations whose photos were never moved to the new directory layout.
