HiddenConfDesc_SUPPLIER_ORDER_DEFAULT_PAYMENT_MODE_ID=Value is the ID (<code>rowid</code>) of a payment method of the dictionary table <code>llx_c_paiement</code>. Used only when the supplier has no payment method defined.
