HiddenConfTitle_SUPPLIER_ORDER_WITH_PREDEFINED_PRICES_ONLY=Only allow products having a price for this supplier in supplier orders
HiddenConfDesc_SUPPLIER_ORDER_WITH_PREDEFINED_PRICES_ONLY=With <code>1</code>, the product list only contains products with a buying price for the supplier, and the minimum quantity is checked and prefilled. <code>2</code> restricts the list the same way without the minimum quantity check.
HiddenConfTitle_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=Create a public download link for the PDF of price requests
HiddenConfDesc_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_ALLOW_EXTERNAL_DOWNLOAD=A share key is set on the generated document, and the substitution variable <code>__DIRECTDOWNLOAD_URL_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL__</code> can be used in email templates.
HiddenConfTitle_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_WITH_PREDEFINED_PRICES_ONLY=Only allow products having a price for this supplier in price requests
HiddenConfDesc_SUPPLIER_PROPOSAL_WITH_PREDEFINED_PRICES_ONLY=With <code>1</code>, the product list only contains products with a buying price for the supplier, and the minimum quantity is checked and prefilled. <code>2</code> restricts the list the same way without the minimum quantity check.

