HiddenConfWarning_MAIN_SUPPORT_SHARED_CONTACT_BETWEEN_THIRDPARTIES=Flagged as unstable in the code: permissions and contact import may not handle shared contacts well.
HiddenConfTitle_MEMBER_CAN_CONVERT_CUSTOMERS_TO_MEMBERS=Add a "New member" button on the card of customers
