HiddenConfTitle_SOCIETE_DISABLE_STATE=Do not use the state/province field
HiddenConfDesc_SOCIETE_DISABLE_STATE=Hidden on forms (including public forms) and in displayed addresses.
HiddenConfTitle_SOCIETE_DISABLE_WORKFORCE=Hide the workforce field on the third party card
HiddenConfTitle_SOCIETE_EMAIL_MANDATORY=Make the email mandatory for third parties
