HiddenConfDesc_WEBSITE_USE_WEBSITE_ACCOUNTS=Added a dedicated table and a tab on the third party card.

# WYSIWYG Editor
HiddenConfTitle_FCKEDITOR_ALLOW_ANY_CONTENT=Disable content filtering of the WYSIWYG editor
HiddenConfDesc_FCKEDITOR_ALLOW_ANY_CONTENT=All HTML tags and attributes are kept. This removes an important protection of the editor, use it with care.
HiddenConfTitle_FCKEDITOR_ENABLE_DETAILS_FULL=Use the full WYSIWYG toolbar for line descriptions
HiddenConfDesc_FCKEDITOR_ENABLE_DETAILS_FULL=The toolbar of notes is used instead of the reduced one, which allows inserting images. PDF generation may fail with some content, and an external image that disappears breaks the document.
HiddenConfTitle_FCKEDITOR_ENABLE_SCAYT_AUTOSTARTUP=Start the spell checker of the WYSIWYG editor automatically
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ALLOW_WYSIWYG_EVEN_ON_UNSECURED_EXTERNAL_HTTP_URL=Allow media links using plain http URLs in WYSIWYG content
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ALLOW_WYSIWYG_EVEN_ON_UNSECURED_EXTERNAL_HTTP_URL=By default, external media with an http (not https) URL are refused when Dolibarr itself is served in http.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ALLOW_WYSIWYG_LOCAL_MEDIAS_ON_PRIVATE_NETWORK=Allow media links to local or private network addresses in WYSIWYG content
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ALLOW_WYSIWYG_LOCAL_MEDIAS_ON_PRIVATE_NETWORK=By default, images or media pointing to localhost or a private IP are refused in rich text content.

# STRIPE Module
HiddenConfTitle_STRIPE_FORCE_VERSION=Stripe API version used by Dolibarr
HiddenConfDesc_STRIPE_FORCE_VERSION=Format <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code>. Default is <code>2022-11-15</code>.
HiddenConfTitle_STRIPE_REUSE_EXISTING_INTENT_IF_FOUND=Reuse the existing Stripe payment intent of an object instead of creating a new one
HiddenConfDesc_STRIPE_REUSE_EXISTING_INTENT_IF_FOUND=Not applied with card present (terminal) payments.

# ClickToDial Module
HiddenConfTitle_CLICKTODIAL_FORCENEWTARGET=Open click-to-dial links in a new browser tab

# For SaaS / Cloud hosting integrators
HiddenConfTitle_MAILING_LIMIT_SENDBYDAY=Maximum number of emails per day shown in mass emailing warnings
HiddenConfDesc_MAILING_LIMIT_SENDBYDAY=Only informative: Dolibarr shows it in warnings but does not block sending. The value can also come from <code>$dolibarr_mailing_limit_sendbyday</code> in <code>conf.php</code>, which takes precedence.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_ALWAYS_CREATE_LOCK_AFTER_LAST_UPGRADE=Always create the install.lock file at the end of an upgrade
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_ALWAYS_CREATE_LOCK_AFTER_LAST_UPGRADE=Install, upgrade and repair tools are then locked until the lock file is removed, even if the upgrade was not to the latest version.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_EXTERNAL_SMTP_SPF_STRING_TO_ADD=SPF value to suggest in the email setup page
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_EXTERNAL_SMTP_SPF_STRING_TO_ADD=Shown in a help message so that users add it to the SPF record of their domain. Useful when you preconfigure your own SMTP server.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FILECHECK_LOCAL_SUFFIX=Suffix of the signature file used by the file integrity checker
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FILECHECK_LOCAL_SUFFIX=Lets you check a customized Dolibarr against your own signature file, e.g. <code>filelist-X.Y.Z-mysuffix.xml</code> generated with <code>build/generate_filelist_xml.php</code>. Use <code>MAIN_FILECHECK_LOCAL_EXT</code> = <code>.zip</code> for a zipped file.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_FIRST_PING_OK_ID=Disable the anonymous ping sent after installation
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_FIRST_PING_OK_ID=Set it to <code>disabled</code>. Otherwise Dolibarr stores here the identifier of the ping already done.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_HIDE_WARNING_TO_ENCOURAGE_SMTP_SETUP=Hide the warning encouraging to set up an SMTP server
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_HIDE_WARNING_TO_ENCOURAGE_SMTP_SETUP=Set to <code>1</code> by default when not defined. Set <code>0</code> to show the warning while the PHP mail method is used.
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_NO_UPGRADE_REDIRECT_ON_LEVEL_3_CHANGE=Do not redirect to the upgrade page for a maintenance version change
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_NO_UPGRADE_REDIRECT_ON_LEVEL_3_CHANGE=The upgrade page is then shown automatically only when the major or minor version changes (X or Y in X.Y.Z).
HiddenConfTitle_MAIN_SETUP_MODULES_DESC=Always show the help text explaining how to enable modules
HiddenConfDesc_MAIN_SETUP_MODULES_DESC=Without it, the text is shown on the modules setup page only while few modules are enabled.
HiddenConfTitle_SYSLOG_DISABLE_LOGHANDLER_SYSLOG=Disable the system syslog log handler
HiddenConfDesc_SYSLOG_DISABLE_LOGHANDLER_SYSLOG=Useful on hosting with many instances, to avoid all of them writing to the same system log.
HiddenConfTitle_WEBSITE_REPLACE_INFO_ABOUT_USAGE_WITH_WEBSERVER=Extra message shown in the website deployment help
HiddenConfDesc_WEBSITE_REPLACE_INFO_ABOUT_USAGE_WITH_WEBSERVER=Value is a text or a translation key, for example to tell that publishing a website needs an extra subscription.
